{"id":"30961","texts":[{"kind":"transcription","label":"תעתיק","editor":"elbaum","citation":"Alan Elbaum, [digital geniza document edition] (n.p., 2022).","html":"<section dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"ar\"> <div data-canvas=\"https://geniza.princeton.edu/documents/30961/iiif/canvas/1/\"> <h3>Recto</h3> <p> </p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>فاما ما اتمنته في معنى التمر والصباغ [------]ـين</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>صحبة المندوبين عليهما فمنها صح بلا عنبار</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p> </div> </section>"}]}